<SiteLayout title="Website Privacy & Local Brief Tool | Bright Solar" description="How the Bright Solar website and local assessment brief tool handle information, including downloads, third-party fonts and external reference links.">
<section class="utility-copy"><h1>Website privacy</h1><p>This notice covers the current Bright Solar website and its local assessment brief tool. It does not describe a future enquiry service or an implementation partner’s separate processing.</p><h2>The assessment brief stays on your device.</h2><p>The form generates a text file in your browser. Its fields are not submitted to Bright Solar, stored by this tool in browser storage, or sent to an installation partner. Changing the fields after generating a brief requires you to rebuild it. Reloading or leaving the page can lose your notes.</p><p>Do not enter account numbers, identity documents or other sensitive information. If you download a brief, you control where that file is stored and who receives it. Online enquiry delivery and booking are not available through this tool.</p><h2>Website requests and outside services</h2><p>Your browser requests page files and images from the website host. It also requests font files from Google Fonts. Those requests can expose technical information, including your IP address, to the service receiving them. <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy">Read Google’s privacy policy</a> for its processing details.</p><p>Links to Meralco or other reference sites take you to separate services with their own policies. The current site does not include advertising trackers, an analytics integration or a customer-account system.</p><h2>Before any online enquiry service is added</h2><p>The responsible business contact, collection purpose, recipients, retention arrangements and enquiry-delivery terms will need to be published before the site collects enquiries. This local brief tool is not consent to receive marketing or share information with a partner.</p><p><a href="/assessment/">Return to the brief tool</a></p></section>
</SiteLayout>
